{"id":8834316763335,"title":"Personalized Basketball with Reflection Blanket with Name and Number","handle":"personalized-basketball-with-reflection-blanket-with-name-and-number-266702782c-266702782c","description":"\u003cp\u003eWrap yourself in cozy warmth and showcase your passion for the game with this custom blanket by Jeminise. Perfect for basketball lovers, this blanket features a personalized sports design, making it a thoughtful gift for players, fans, and family members alike. Whether you are lounging on the sofa, relaxing on the bed, or heading out for camping and travel, this versatile blanket provides consecutive warmth in all seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Custom options allow you to personalize this blanket with a Name and Number for a truly unique sports gift.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Cozy Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with two layers of high-quality polyester fabric, available in ultra-soft Sherpa or cozy Fleece options.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVibrant \u0026amp; Long-Lasting:\u003c\/strong\u003e Digitally printed using long-lasting color ink that creates an eye-catching, colorful sports theme.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in four versatile sizes to suit your needs: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight and highly functional for indoor and outdoor activities, perfect for napping, reading, working, traveling, or watching TV.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simple to clean and maintain—machine wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat to keep it fluffy and soft.\u003c\